      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BABYFACE_RECEPT"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "수배범은 그냥 곧장 치안국으로 가라고 했잖아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "手配犯はそのまま治安局に連れて行ってって言ったじゃない。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 44,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STELLAR_THIEF",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "에헤~ 몰라 몰라. 그런 건 그냥 알아서 해줘. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "かーっ、細かいな。その辺はそっちで勝手にしてくれよ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 45,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_MERCHANT_FEMALE_1",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BABYFACE_RECEPT"
      ],
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하아… 일단 수배지에 적힌 녀석 맞는 것 같으니까 현상금은 네 계좌로- ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "はぁ…とにかく、賞金首で合ってるはずよ。懸賞金はあんたの口座に── ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 46,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STELLAR_THIEF",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "현금! 오로지 현금! ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "現金！何が何でも現金！ ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 47,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_MERCHANT_FEMALE_1",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BABYFACE_RECEPT"
      ],
      "EmotionEffect": "QMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…금액이 꽤 되는데? 전부 현금으로?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…かなりの金額よ？ぜんぶ現金で受け取るつもり？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 48,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STELLAR_THIEF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "상관없어. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "関係ねぇ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 49,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_STELLAR_THIEF",
      "CameraOffset": "POS9_2X",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "일류 헌터 특! 항상 현금으로 주머니가 묵직함! ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "一流ハンターたる者！いつも現金で財布がパンパンなのである！ ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 50,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_MERCHANT_FEMALE_1",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BABYFACE_RECEPT"
      ],
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_7",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…잠깐만 기다려. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…ちょっと待ってて。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 51,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_STELLAR_THIEF_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_MERCHANT_FEMALE_3",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_TALKATIVE_RECEPT"
      ],
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_1",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저분인가요? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あの方ですか？ ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 104,
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": -1.0,
      "CutsceneClear": "CLEARUNIT",
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_MERCHANT_FEMALE_1"
    },
    {
